Head:   5bcf6f45028039eb6f83bcfc141f70d96f0ff2d1 (MR state opened, target main, checked 21 Nov 2026)
Review: reviewed: r-b Danylo Piliaiev 12 Nov; on 20 Nov he noted one uncovered niche case (render pass in a non-SIMULTANEOUS_USE secondary run from a SIMULTANEOUS_USE primary)
